 "_about": "撒豆成兵 · 守山门 (the DEFENCE crowd game, test-only beside 撒豆成兵; Hanli 10-21). One row a level. The road runs from the wall (z 0) to the far end (z 100); x is −1 (left) … 1 (right). `gates`: rows at `z`, each cell on [a, b] with op + − x / and n — `cool` s: a big gate lights again only after that long; `alt` + `flip` s: a 符门 swapping faces on the clock. `waves`: the 兽潮, each at `t` s on `span`, [[beast, n]…] (the last kind the front rank), marching at `speed` z/s; `hold`: the beast-power a second that stops a wave cold. `beans`: the stream (`rate` a second, `speed` z/s); `seek`: how near a foe a 豆兵 turns to it. `boss`: walks down from `stand` at `speed`; its `charge` every `every` s, the line shown `warn` s ahead, `half` its half-width, `kill` the share of the 豆兵 on it lost; at the wall it crushes `crush` wall a second. `wall`: the wall's hp; `stars`: [★★★, ★★] by the share of the wall left. `difficulty` scales every wave and the boss's hp (1 = as tuned). `hui`: the 回 the level belongs to — it sends only beasts met by then.",
